{
  "title": "Create a DME order",
  "source": "modules/orders-dme/create-dme-order",
  "url": "https://help.medipyxis.com/modules/orders-dme/create-dme-order/",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "dme-cr-01",
      "claim": "You can also order from the Orders & DME step (Step 11) of the Visit Wizard. It works inside the wizard; it does not open the patient's Orders & DME page.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "path: \"/patients/:patientId/orders\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "<OrdersDMEVisit patientId={patientId} />",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/VisitWizardV4.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "^ +Step 11$",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/VisitWizardV4.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "note": "the only Step 11 badge is the Orders & DME accordion"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "navigate\\(`/patients/\\$\\{patientId\\}/orders`\\)",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/visit-wizard/visit/OrdersDMEVisit.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "absent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dme-cr-02",
      "claim": "You must have prescribing authority or be creating the order on behalf of a supervising provider.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "ignoreCase": true,
          "pattern": "prescrib|supervising",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present",
          "note": "an authority rule would have to appear on the order page"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "No prescribing-authority or supervising-provider check exists on the order path; the page is gated only by the Orders & DME feature (user-routes.tsx /patients/:patientId/orders). This is a policy statement, not product behaviour.",
      "status": "removed",
      "reason": "Policy statement: no prescribing-authority or supervising-provider check exists on the order path. Deleted."
    },
    {
      "id": "dme-cr-03",
      "claim": "From the patient's chart open Orders & DME, or reach it from the Orders & DME section (section 12) of the Visit Wizard (the link carries the patient context automatically).",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "onClick={() => navigate(`/patients/${patientId}/orders`)}",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/patient-overview/PatientOverviewPage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "navigate\\(`/patients/\\$\\{patientId\\}/orders`\\)",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/visit-wizard/visit/OrdersDMEVisit.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "The chart has an Orders & DME tile (PatientOverviewPage.tsx:3571). The wizard step is badged \"Step 11\" (VisitWizardV4.tsx:18207) and embeds its own ordering panel (OrdersDMEVisit, :18233); it has no link to the Orders & DME page.",
      "proposed_text": "From the patient's chart, click Orders & DME. During a visit you can also order from the Orders & DME step (Step 11) of the Visit Wizard, which works inside the wizard.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "onClick={() => navigate(`/patients/${patientId}/orders`)}",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/all-patients/patient-overview/PatientOverviewPage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "pattern": "^ +Step 11$",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/components/VisitWizardV4.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "note": "the only Step 11 badge is the Orders & DME accordion (VisitWizardV4.tsx:18207)"
        }
      ],
      "status": "removed",
      "reason": "The Visit Wizard step is badged Step 11 and has no link to the Orders & DME page. Replaced by dme-cr-17 and the reworded dme-cr-01."
    },
    {
      "id": "dme-cr-04",
      "claim": "Select the DME tab and click New DME Order.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "label: \"DME\",",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx"
          ],
