        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "New {activeTab} Order",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ],
      "reason": "With no DME orders yet, the button reads Create DME Order instead (PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx:1656)."
    },
    {
      "id": "dme-cr-05",
      "claim": "Fill the DME order form top to bottom: select the Patient (type name or DOB, autocomplete); select Equipment Category (HCPCS codes filter by it); choose the Item (HCPCS populates automatically); set Quantity and Units; enter Duration; add Clinical Justification with an ICD-10 picker; select the Ordering Provider (NPI populates from profile); select the Vendor and optional custom form; add Notes.",
      "checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "Equipment Category",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx",
            "backend/supabase/migrations/20260924120000_seed_standard_order_form_library.sql"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "HCPCS code(s), if known",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/migrations/20260924120000_seed_standard_order_form_library.sql"
          ],
          "expect": "absent",
          "note": "a free-text HCPCS box contradicts 'HCPCS populates automatically'"
        }
      ],
      "finding": "There is no fixed DME form with these fields. The flow is: New DME Order → \"Select recipient for DME Order\" (vendor first, :3750) → \"Choose custom form\" (:3857) → the chosen form. The patient is already set (page is per patient). The standard \"Durable Medical Equipment Request\" form (seed 20260924120000:162) has an Equipment checklist (Wheelchair, Walker, Hospital bed, ...), free-text \"HCPCS code(s), if known\", Quantity, \"Length of need / start date\", \"Diagnosis / ICD-10 code(s)\", \"Ordering provider / credentials\" and NPI. There is no equipment category, item picker, HCPCS auto-fill, units, or ICD-10 search; vendor forms vary.",
      "proposed_text": "Click New DME Order, pick the vendor, then pick a form (the vendor's own, or the Medipyxis Durable Medical Equipment Request). Fill in the form: equipment, HCPCS codes if known, quantity, length of need, diagnosis / ICD-10 codes, and ordering provider and NPI.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "<DialogTitle>Select recipient for {activeTab} Order</DialogTitle>",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "<DialogTitle>Choose custom form</DialogTitle>",
          "paths": [
            "frontend/src/pages/PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "'Durable Medical Equipment Request', 'Vendor Request', 1,",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/migrations/20260924120000_seed_standard_order_form_library.sql"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "HCPCS code(s), if known",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/migrations/20260924120000_seed_standard_order_form_library.sql"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        },
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "Diagnosis / ICD-10 code(s)",
          "paths": [
            "backend/supabase/migrations/20260924120000_seed_standard_order_form_library.sql"
          ],
          "expect": "present"
        }
      ],
      "status": "removed",
      "reason": "There is no fixed DME form with these fields; the flow is recipient, then form, then the form's own fields. Replaced by dme-cr-14, dme-cr-19, dme-cr-20 and dme-cr-21."
    },
