      ],
      "finding": "Send Fax records the order and sets Submitted (ensureOrderForSend :1265, recordFaxSend :1335; status written in ordersDmeService.ts:324). Send Email (handleSendVendorEmail, PatientOrdersDmePage.tsx:1371-1517) sends the email and shows a toast but never creates or updates the order — no status change. Product defect: emailed orders leave no Submitted record.",
      "proposed_text": "Save the order as a draft, or click Send Fax to send it to the vendor; a faxed order moves to Submitted once the fax is accepted. Send Email emails the form but does not update the order's status.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        {
          "type": "grep",
          "fixed": true,
          "pattern": "await OrdersDmeService.recordFaxSend({",
          "paths": [
